# Visual baselines are Chromium on Linux, generated in the image CI runs.
# A baseline written by a local Windows or macOS run would be compared against
# on that platform only, so it would sit in the repository proving nothing while
# looking like coverage. Generate them with `yarn docker:vr:update`.
vr-tests/__screenshots__/**/*-win32.png
vr-tests/__screenshots__/**/*-darwin.png
